commit 7a6ea17f9d52f73be5f53fab365dd9e8075d6631

C03: a microphone mute scoped to a voice client asks whether to mute the system microphone (UI1655)

«silencia mi microfono en discord», «mutea el micrófono en discord», «Sí. Silencia mi micrófono en Discord» and «en Discord apretá silenciar» ask to be muted inside a voice client. BAXY operates the Windows capture endpoint, not the client's mute control; the microphone reader excludes the client scope on purpose, so the order went to the model. It now decides an explicit clarification of audio.microphone.mute (system_microphone_confirmation, zero operations) whose question offers the system microphone (the application would stop receiving it), validated to name it and to claim neither the client button nor a mute already done; a bare «silencia mi micrófono» stays the system mute.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


